The '''magma strykewyrm''' is the [[Superior slayer monster|superior]] variant of the [[lava strykewyrm]]. It has a chance of spawning while on a wyrm slayer task, after purchasing the unlock ''Bigger and Badder'' for 50 [[Slayer reward point]]s from any [[Slayer master]]. 

Like lava strykewyrms, magma strykewyrms attack with both [[ranged]] and [[melee]]. Magma strykewyrms also have a special attack, where it burrows to player's location and deals 20+ damage if the player doesn't move away from that location within a few seconds. Note that this special attack can happen even if the player is standing next to a wall, so it cannot be avoided like the [[Lizardman shaman|lizardman shamans]]' similar special attack. 

Just like the regular lava strykewyrms, magma strykewyrms can be safespotted by outranging their attacks and will not use its special attack.

